															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607200785" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;" >stormbreath</a></span> <span class="odate time_1558301049 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">19 May 2019 21:24</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4254619">
									

<p>Thanks to Rounderhouse, DrChandra, DarkStuff and RadioactiveRads for looking at this.</p>
<p>So there's two layers to this: what happened, and how the people of the town reacted. The second is directly connected to the anomaly, and the first is incidental. I have a headcanon in mind for what the first is, but it's something that I don't plan to reveal. As for the second&#8230;.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">spoilers</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Callam Township is a small town, where something very bad (abuse, murder, drugs &#8212; something scandalous) happened, and a lot of people got together to coverup, and all agreed to <em>never talk about it again</em>. Their deep-held devotion to that idea of not talking about it caused it to become anomalous, they kept refusing to talk until nobody could talk, even those who weren't in on it.</p>
<p>The actual event isn't as important as the reaction.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

